# Determinism-matrix rows on which a level overlay's anti-piracy scan runs
# to its end (tests/harness/check_determinism_matrix.sh, games/spyro-3/
# features/antipiracy_scan.c). One row per line: the bk2 stem under
# games/spyro-3/bk2/, the cell's VBL limit, and the least number of
# `antipiracy: ... complete: PASS` lines each cell's log must carry. A cell
# below that count, or carrying an `antipiracy: FAIL` line, fails the run:
# a scan that stops running or fails is a gate failure. Without
# --scenarios, every row joins the matrix's default scenario list; a row
# runs the baseline cell (4:3, default fov) only. Each
# movie's .bk2.args holds its input and the make_bk2.py spans that wrote it.
#
# sheilas-alp-idle-scan: no input after --skip-to-level sheilas_alp; the
# three scanner mobies of func_level_16_80079AF4 end their EXE and overlay
# passes at VBL 8091 (3261 calls each). The one-function scanner
# func_level_16_80079654 takes one step and stops while idle; it is not
# counted.
sheilas-alp-idle-scan 8600 3
# cloud-spires-npc-scan: func_level_12_8007C2B8 (data byte 0 == 1) passes
# at VBL 9367.
cloud-spires-npc-scan 9800 1
# dino-mines-walk-scan: func_level_44_80081188 passes at VBL 10163.
dino-mines-walk-scan 10500 1
# sgt-byrds-base-scan: three func_level_26_8007C6F8 scanners pass at VBL
# 5111, func_level_26_8007FC74 at VBL 9133.
sgt-byrds-base-scan 9600 4
# buzzs-dungeon-fight-scan: func_level_17_8007A770 passes at VBL 2321, 3953
# and 8027 (it restarts after each pass), func_level_17_8007774C at VBL 8685.
buzzs-dungeon-fight-scan 9200 4
# spikes-arena-fight-scan: func_level_27_8007A3C0 passes at VBL 2321, 3961,
# 7981 and 10265, func_level_27_8007797C at VBL 9551.
spikes-arena-fight-scan 10000 5
# scorchs-pit-fight-scan: func_level_37_8007EFFC passes at VBL 2993, 7773
# and 9669, func_level_37_8007BD9C at VBL 11551.
scorchs-pit-fight-scan 12000 4
# sorceresss-lair-fight-scan: func_level_47_80079AC4 passes at VBL 5791 and
# 7989, func_level_47_8007CF38 at VBL 9887.
sorceresss-lair-fight-scan 9700 3
# sunny-villa-area-2-idle-scan: func_level_11_80080CE0 (class 313, placed
# only in Sunny Villa's area 2) passes at VBL 9581.
sunny-villa-area-2-idle-scan 10000 1
